      "message": "Why do you say \"supposed to be rendered\"? According to who (or what)?\n\nI\u0027m not necessarily opposed to this change, but I\u0027m trying to understand the thinking a bit better.\n\nFWIW, Classic Sites italicized the quotes and indented them:\n\nhttps://sites.google.com/a/chromium.org/dev/Home/chromium-security/education/tls/#cipher-suites\n\nLooks like I missed the indentation in the migration, so I\u0027m definitely fine with that change. I also agree that the blockquotes aren\u0027t really called out enough on the current pages.",
